    note: "Warren/Pratt through truss, lower right chord B11-B13 below deck for depth at building zone, all pinned, S355 CHS sized by utilisation feedback with robustness margins",
    nodes: NODES.map(n => ({ id: n[0], x: n[1], y: n[2], joint: "pin" })),
    joints: {},
